### 2. Controlled Application Backend Tools (`backend/src/tools/`)
- Built [`backend/src/tools/reconciliationTools.js`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/backend/src/tools/reconciliationTools.js) defining OpenAI/Groq tool function schemas and MySQL execution handlers:
  - `searchCompany` — Searches borrower companies by name, tax ID, or bank account.
  - `getActiveLoans` — Retrieves active loan facilities for a company.
  - `getDueRepayments` — Retrieves expected installment schedule.
  - `getPaymentHistory` — Compares historical payment behavior.
  - `getBankAccountDetails` — Matches bank narration against registered company bank accounts.
  - `checkDuplicateTransactions` — Scans for duplicate transaction references and pattern matches.

### 3. Payment Reconciliation Agent Loop Engine (`backend/src/agents/`)
- Built [`backend/src/agents/reconciliationAgent.js`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/backend/src/agents/reconciliationAgent.js):
  - Fetches case & payment details from MySQL.
  - Sets case status to `ai_processing`.
  - Executes Groq LLM tool calling loop (`groq.chat.completions.create` with `tools` array).
  - Processes tool calls requested by Groq, executes local JS function handlers, appends tool response messages, and sends back to Groq until Groq produces a final candidate match.
  - Features fallback rule-based matching engine (`runFallbackRuleBasedMatching`) if API key is unconfigured or encounters network timeouts.
  - Inserts candidate match into `ai_recommendations` table (`status = 'pending'`).
  - Updates `reconciliation_cases.status` based on confidence score ($\ge 90\%$ `pending_review`, $70-89\%$ `pending_review`, $<70\%$ `under_review`).
- Created [`reconciliationAgent.md`](file:///c:/Users/hemav/OneDrive/Desktop/Yuvan/Week-7/backend/src/agents/reconciliationAgent.md) documentation.

